Hi {Owner},

I build websites and client portals for design-build remodeling firms. {Business Name} has excellent renovation work posted, but the site doesn't explain the paid design phase, the portfolio isn't sorted by project type, and the enquiry form doesn't ask budget or timing.

I built a sample instead of asking for a meeting: a portfolio filtered by additions, whole-home and villa renovations, a design-phase page, team profiles, a client portal preview and a qualifying enquiry form, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

The site runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, project updates and reporting. A client portal and project system connection are scoped separately.

Worth thirty minutes with you and your design lead?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
